event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":77,"item_id":"rs_0509ef6a69b5530f016acd304f5b2887d28e0b9c7c7bdcae30","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Evaluating module validation**\n\nI’m thinking about whether to implement validation in a separate module. This could be really useful for direct tests and help keep the server function straightforward. I want a small, portable module that can easily be imported and reused across different parts of the project. It's also good to prioritize clarity and functionality around date handling. I hope there's enough time left to manage this effectively!"}

